OL,3,GNEWSASenedd to relocate office staff
OL,4,Afor major refurbishment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe body which runs the Senedd says it
OL,7,Fis embarking on its "most complex ever
OL,8,Fproject" as it prepares to relocate
OL,9,Fstaff and politicians while
OL,10,Frefurbishment work is carried out on
OL,11,Ftheir existing offices.
OL,13,FThe Senedd Commission has been
OL,14,Fconsidering how to proceed when its
OL,15,Flease on the TE7 Hywel building -
OL,16,Fsituated directly behind the Senedd -
OL,17,Fends in 2032.
OL,19,FIts preference is to remain in a
OL,20,Frefurbished TE7 Hywel, which would mean
OL,21,Fhaving to move staff into neighbouring
OL,22,Faccommodation until 2030.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
